# Waze NCA Scanner — project overview

Scans NCA cadastral map (map.nca.by WFS), stores **address points** in PostGIS, serves WME userscript.

| Piece | Path | Notes |
|-------|------|-------|
| API | `server/` | NestJS + TypeORM + `@nestjs/schedule` |
| Deploy | `deploy/` | Compose on VPS; nginx TLS |
| Userscript | `wme-nca-addresses-nearby.user.js` | Also mirrored in `wme-scripts` |

**Production:** `https://waze-nca-scanner.ster.by`  
**Repo:** `/home/anton/projects/waze-nca-scanner` → `github.com/ixxvivxxi/waze-nca-scanner`  
**Related:** `/home/anton/projects/wme-scripts` (Tampermonkey scripts)

Prod DB is **shared `main-postgres`** with PostGIS (`postgis/postgis:16-3.4`). Local dev uses `server/docker-compose.yml` PostGIS on port 5433.

Do **not** commit secrets (`deploy/.env.prod`, `server/.env`). Never invent deploy passwords.
